avior recovered. Fixed lifecycle boot identities independently agree with the executor observations.","evidence_ids":["cmd-c31d2acb73be4a0f","cmd-80c3432e126e4206","cmd-f1edb0638aa4431a","cmd-be5cf5495be34bda","cmd-5a27622410704b24","cmd-8b7ab9fe36aa4fe4","cmd-f4daad96204948e3","cmd-10c92ff8b6d94a70","global:before_prepare:node1:boot-identity","global:after_executor:node1:boot-identity","global:before_prepare:node1:temporary-files","global:after_executor:node1:temporary-files","global:before_prepare:node1:failed-services","global:after_executor:node1:failed-services","global:before_prepare:node1:package-health","global:after_executor:node1:package-health"]},"overall_summary":"All material task outcomes are satisfied with direct behavioral evidence. The platform group and private setgid workspace survived a confirmed node restart, two group-member identities collaborated successfully, and an outsider was consistently denied access. The provider-wide restart protocol is coherent and independently corroborated by the lifecycle boot snapshots.","limitations":[]}
